### C2C QARZ SHARTNOMASI v2 — haqdor/qarzdor (avtomatik user ma'lumotlari)
@host = http://localhost:8005
@token = <YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN>
@templateId = a1000001-0001-4001-8001-000000000011
@sellerId = <HAQDOR_USER_UUID>
@buyerId = <QARZDOR_USER_UUID>

### Shablon maydonlari (faqat priceWords ixtiyoriy)
GET {{host}}/api/document/v1/template/field/{{templateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### C2C hujjat yaratish — user ma'lumotlari values da KERAK EMAS
POST {{host}}/api/document/v1/c2c
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sellerId": "{{sellerId}}",
  "buyerId": "{{buyerId}}",
  "templateId": "{{templateId}}",
  "price": 5000000,
  "currency": "UZS",
  "initialPayment": 0,
  "deliveryAt": null,
  "number": "QARZ-0002",
  "witnessIds": [],
  "values": [
    {
      "keyName": "priceWords",
      "value": "besh million so'm",
      "templateId": "{{templateId}}",
      "templateFieldId": "a1000002-0001-4001-8001-000000000021"
    }
  ],
  "payments": [
    {
      "amount": 2500000,
      "paymentDate": "2026-06-30T00:00:00Z"
    },
    {
      "amount": 2500000,
      "paymentDate": "2026-07-30T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "products": []
}

### PDF — creditor/debtor avtomatik to'ldiriladi
@docId = <DOCUMENT_UUID>
GET {{host}}/api/document/v1/generate/{{docId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
